    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Unbroken Guard</h2><p><em>You stand where others would rather not.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>When a creature within 1 square of you targets an ally with an attack, you may use your reaction to Impose the attacker (that attack rolls 3d10 keep-lowest-2) and reduce the attacker’s movement to 0 until the end of its current turn.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>🃏 Card — reaction; target the attacker: Imposed, movement 0 (GM).</em></p>",
